 An image of Shri Kareda Parshwanath is also found in the Kalikund Parshwanath temple in Santacruz, Mumbai, at the 108 Parshwanath Bhakti Vihar Tirth, and at Jiravala Tirth.\\\"}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Praise (Stuti): O Lord, whose renovation was carried out by minister Jhanjhan — through praise of you, all divinely-caused afflictions are driven far away; your name is such that it strikes karma like a whip. \\\\\\\"With devotion I bow to Shri Kareda Parshwa.\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Chanting Mantra: \\\\\\\"Om Hrim Arham Shri Kareda Parshwanathaya Namah.\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Trust: Shri Jain Shwetambar Murtipujak Shri Kareda Parshwanathji Tirth Pedhi, Bhupalsagar: 312052, District: Chittorgarh, State of Rajasthan, India. Phone: 01476-84233, Mobile: 07073224862.\\\"}]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rscData":"","segmentData":{"/_tree":"","/_full":"","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug":"","/$d$lang/tirtha":"","/$d$lang":"","/_index":"","/_head":""},"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/tirtha/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/tirtha/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/tirtha/[slug]/page,_N_T_/en/tirtha/tirtha-110"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug","/$d$lang/tirtha","/$d$lang","/_index","/_head"],"revalidate":60,"cacheControl":{"revalidate":60,"expire":31536000}}}